				110,
				2
			],
			"Message": "docs(Vine): Consolidate protocol architecture documentation\n\nThe architecture documentation has been restructured to reflect the current\ngRPC protocol layer. `Documentation/GitHub/Architecture.md` now presents a\nsingle `Vine.proto` schema with `MountainService` and `CocoonService`,\nreplacing the prior split between `Vine.proto` and `Spine.proto`.\n\nService definition tables, port allocation, and configuration sections are\nupdated to show the finalized topology: Mountain Vine on 50051, Cocoon Vine\non 50052, and Air Vine on 50053. Multiplexed streaming channels are documented\nin the service tables.\n\n`Documentation/GitHub/DeepDive.md` is revised to match: the architecture diagram\nnow includes `AirClient`, the key modules table reflects the current source tree\nstructure, and integration points include a dedicated listening addresses table.\n\nThese changes align documentation with the live implementation and remove\nreferences to the deprecated Spine coordination layer.",
